OL,3,AFlash flood on Nepal-Tibet border kills
OL,4,Amore than 100, with hundreds of
OL,5,Atourists missing
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of police officers and army
OL,8,Fpersonnel are also missing, as well as
OL,9,Fpower workers. My family was swept away
OL,10,Fin front of me, one woman tells us -
OL,11,Fshe and her son survived by climbing to
OL,12,Fa rooftop
OL,14,FIn Tibet, Chinese state media report
OL,15,Fthree dead and 265 missing. CCTV from
OL,16,FTibet shows a wall of water and mud
OL,17,Fhitting buildings at a border crossing
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
